ues** (#229 to #246) created, linked as sub-issues of #227 through the GitHub API, with blockers registered through the dependencies API. The milestone issue #246 is blocked by the other 16 feature issues.\n\n**Measured baseline** on v0.22.0 across 3055 corpus rows:\n\n| Status | Rows |\n|---|---|\n| supported | 640 (20.9%) |\n| different | 213 |\n| unsupported | 2202 |\n\n<details>\n<summary>Rest of the working session summary (918 characters)</summary>\n\n```text\n| timeout | 0 |\n\n**CI status**\n\nThe first two runs failed on two jobs. The missing changelog fragment was fixed in the docs commit. The Dependency Freshness job failed because seven web packages had new releases published after main last passed on Oct 3, which the repo's convention from PR #226 treats as an error. I bumped those packages to the latest versions, verified the 229 web unit tests and the TypeScript build locally, and documented the bump in the changelog fragment and the PR description. The run for the final commit passed every job, including Web Build with the new Vite version.\n\nThe branch is level with main, the working tree is clean apart from the intentionally untracked `ci-logs/` directory, and there are no comments on the issue or the PR to address. One background poll command was stopped by its time limit, but the same check was repeated in the foreground and confirmed the green result.\n```\n\n</details>\n\n---\n*This summary was automatically extracted from the AI working session output.*","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/link-assistant/calculator/issues/comments/6036057126/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null,"event":"commented","actor":{"login":"konard","id":1431904,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE0MzE5MDQ=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1431904?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/user